{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wildekin is a 3D pixel-art adventure where up to 4 friends can build, explore, survive and thrive\u2014or at least try to before some creature tries to turn you into a light snack!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1368180/extras/df4b58d40551da69ea08596529d2e235.avif?t=1755794050\" width=600 height=76 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1368180/extras/0eb4ed2597c36ddf8a3d15ba22cf44c5.poster.avif?t=1755794050\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1368180/extras/0eb4ed2597c36ddf8a3d15ba22cf44c5.webm?t=1755794050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up for a chaotic adventure together with online co-op for up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plot a course to explore new islands, and garb yourself in the right gear to survive in each environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight monsters, loot treasure, and steal sea charts from bosses to unlock even stranger lands</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use weapons, gizmos, and your wits to navigate dungeons and their deadly puzzles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1368180/extras/15fda55433a52667e452891f8cd23705.avif?t=1755794050\" width=600 height=76 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1368180/extras/7708cfd512ba8a1cf3fec1efe5c3eb50.poster.avif?t=1755794050\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1368180/extras/7708cfd512ba8a1cf3fec1efe5c3eb50.webm?t=1755794050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct, decorate, and micromanage your village like a tiny, furry dictator - or errm.. \u201ctown planner\u201d</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don your builder\u2019s hat and redesign the layout of your town as and when you like</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft gear, grow crops and arrange furniture\u2014because nothing says \u201cI live here\u201d like a crafting station randomly placed in the middle of your town.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign jobs to rescued Wildekin so that they can help revitalise the town (they\u2019ll thank you\u2026 probably)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build stores such as a forge, a workshop and the Inventorium Emporium to aid you in your adventuring, or just open a music shop if you\u2019re looking to start a tonally-challenged tribute band</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1368180/extras/68865f5cf39b20ea2a465ed14942bfa0.avif?t=1755794050\" width=600 height=76 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1368180/extras/27512c6a107dde43bcf469eefc3b865a.poster.avif?t=1755794050\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1368180/extras/27512c6a107dde43bcf469eefc3b865a.webm?t=1755794050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend Wildekin with unique personalities and strong opinions on turnips</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allow yourself to be judged by your neighbours by taking part in contests and seasonal events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete billboard requests because nothing says \u201clocal hero\u201d like fetching someone\u2019s lost socks from a volcano dungeon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1368180/extras/5ecb2e7962be53c6889475131cc4b8e4.poster.avif?t=1755794050\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1368180/extras/5ecb2e7962be53c6889475131cc4b8e4.webm?t=1755794050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1368180/extras/31028000cc8d8be250e1b85a3ae08568.avif?t=1755794050\" width=610 height=230 /></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1368180?t=1755794050","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1368180/f0d4c1a9a76c95d129b03cf162718b6733036786/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755794050","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1368180/9db822538d4a0080c3